<section>
    <h2>CSS Custom Properties</h2>

    <p>unit.gl provides density and breakpoint values as CSS custom properties for use in calculations:</p>

    <div class="code-block"><pre><code>:root {
        <span class="comment">/* Density (JavaScript-injected) */</span>
        --dpr: 1;
        --dpr-inverse: 1;

        <span class="comment">/* Density-adjusted grid */</span>
        --grid-unit: 0.5rem; <span class="comment">/* q(8) */</span>
        --grid-unit-density: calc(var(--grid-unit) * var(--dpr-inverse));

        <span class="comment">/* Physical-to-digital multiplier */</span>
        --mm-to-px: 4;

        <span class="comment">/* Q-format-derived breakpoints (9-step scale) */</span>
        --bp-us: 240px;  <span class="comment">/* Ultra Small  | Q07 Portrait  */</span>
        --bp-ss: 360px;  <span class="comment">/* Super Small  | Q06 Portrait  */</span>
        --bp-xs: 540px;  <span class="comment">/* Extra Small  | Q05 Portrait  */</span>
        --bp-sm: 720px;  <span class="comment">/* Small        | Q04 Portrait  */</span>
        --bp-md: 1080px; <span class="comment">/* Medium       | Q04 Landscape */</span>
        --bp-lg: 1440px; <span class="comment">/* Large        | Q03 Landscape */</span>
        --bp-xl: 2160px; <span class="comment">/* Extra Large  | Q02 Landscape */</span>
        --bp-sl: 2880px; <span class="comment">/* Super Large  | Q01 Landscape */</span>
        --bp-ul: 4320px; <span class="comment">/* Ultra Large  | Q00 Landscape */</span>
        }

        <span class="comment">/* Usage example */</span>
        .element {
        <span class="comment">/* Density-aware spacing */</span>
        padding: var(--grid-unit-density);

        <span class="comment">/* Container query using breakpoint */</span>
        max-width: var(--bp-md);
        }</code></pre></div>

</section>
